        "name": "assert",
        "doc": " Submit an assertion from a source. The claim's verdict is\n resolved with the LOCAL gate (see `resolve`); a cross-contract\n promise to the kernel's `lpres_join` is the audit path (see the\n `verify` example in the consumer contract). Never reverts the\n caller on a contradiction — the dispute is recorded as BOTH.",
        "kind": "call",
        "params": {
          "serialization_type": "json",
          "args": [
            {
              "name": "claim_id",
              "type_schema": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
